WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.480
Ceritakan ruang anda.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.900
Setujui skop dan tandatangani
borang pesanan.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.080
Kongsi pelan secara peribadi.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.320
Kami bina model tiga dimensi anda.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.860
Anda semak, kemudian terima
pautan web.

